/* --- 工具输出卡片化 ---
   对齐 ZCode：工具调用结果（Glob、终端这类）在灰底画布上是「白色圆角卡 +
   细边框」，深色是「面板色圆角卡 + 白 10% 边框」。卡片色走两个专用变量
   （--dsw-zcode-tool-card-*，调试面板的滑块直接改它们），挂点用
   `data-chat-flow-kind='tool-call'`（DSH 会话流的语义属性，跨版本稳定），
   不碰哈希类名；助手正文不加卡，保持贴在画布上。 */
body[data-smkit-theme="zcode"] {
  --dsw-zcode-tool-card-bg: #ffffff;
  --dsw-zcode-tool-card-border: rgba(13, 13, 13, 0.08);
}

body[data-smkit-theme="zcode"][data-ds-dark-theme] {
  --dsw-zcode-tool-card-bg: #202020;
  --dsw-zcode-tool-card-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
}

body[data-smkit-theme="zcode"] [data-chat-flow-kind='tool-call'] > div {
  background: var(--dsw-zcode-tool-card-bg, #ffffff);
  border: 1px solid var(--dsw-zcode-tool-card-border, rgba(13, 13, 13, 0.08));
  border-radius: 10px;
  overflow: hidden;
}

/* The terminal body paints its own hardcoded fill (._block_1gdtu_1's
   `background: #ffffff`), which covers the card above it — the slider moved
   the wrapper and the terminal did not follow. Point the body at the same
   variables; [data-terminal] is the attribute the component stamps the block
   with, terminalBody its CSS-modules suffix. */
body[data-smkit-theme="zcode"] [data-chat-flow-kind='tool-call'] [data-terminal],
body[data-smkit-theme="zcode"] [data-chat-flow-kind='tool-call'] [class*='terminalBody'] {
  background: var(--dsw-zcode-tool-card-bg, #ffffff);
}

